<title>SWEDEN: Coca-Cola finalises end of Pripps Ringnes dea.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola finalises end of Pripps Ringnes dea.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beverage group Coca-Cola Co said on Tuesday that it had signed a final agreement with Nordic drinks company Pripps Ringnes AB to end the two companies' cooperation.</p>
<p>From April 1 Coca Cola Drycker Sverige AB will be responsible for its own sales and distribution in Sweden although Pripps Ringnes, a joint venture by Volvo AB and Norwegian conglomerate Orkla ASA, will continue production until December 31.</p>
</text>
